---
manual: edit_line.focus
lines: [3092, 3095]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @first = edit_line
  @second = edit_line
end
----------- test code
second = edit_line("@second")
second.focus
assert_equal second.linkable_id, focused_drawable&.linkable_id, "focus moves keyboard focus to the edit line"

type_text "no click needed"
assert_equal "no click needed", second.text, "the user can type straight into it"
refute_equal "no click needed", edit_line("@first").text, "the other line gets nothing"
